{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國電影評論家協會舉行的《第46屆韓國影評獎》今午在首爾麻浦區舉行頒獎禮，大會事前已公布得獎名單，男星趙寅成與女星全度妍分別憑韓片《HOPE：逆襲希望港》及《假如愛有如果》獲得榮膺影帝影后，兩人一同現身領獎，至於《HOPE》的導演羅泓軫贏得</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:45:40.191747+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:19:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.196116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.196116+00:00","content_hash":"bfb4477320d66e6fcc140d417da46ba31d7fd9b50ff4e90acec62e8476db804d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}